#. module: website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website.s_quotes_carousel_compact
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website.s_quotes_carousel_minimal
msgid ""
"\" A trusted partner for growth. <br/>Professional, efficient, and always "
"ahead of the curve. \""
msgstr "\" ຄູ່ຮ່ວມງານທີ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືເພື່ອການເຕີບໂຕ. <br/>ມືອາຊີບ, ມີປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ກ້າວໜ້າສະເໝີ. \""

#. module: website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website.s_quotes_carousel_compact
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website.s_quotes_carousel_minimal
msgid ""
"\" Outstanding service and results! <br/>They exceeded our expectations in "
"every project. \""
msgstr ""
"\" ບໍລິການ ແລະ ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ໂດດເດັ່ນ! <br/"
">ພວກເຂົາເຮັດໄດ້ເກີນຄວາມຄາດຫວັງຂອງພວກເຮົາໃນທຸກໆໂຄງການ. \""

#. module: website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website.s_quotes_carousel
msgid ""
"\" Their team understood our needs from day one. The result was a reliable "
"solution that made our daily work much easier. \""
msgstr ""
"\" ທີມງານຂອງພວກເຂົາເຂົ້າໃຈຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງພວກເຮົາຕັ້ງແຕ່ມື້ທຳອິດ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນວິທີແກ້ໄຂທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ວຽກງານປະຈຳວັນຂອງພວກເຮົາງ່າຍຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ. \""

#. module: website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website.s_quotes_carousel_compact
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website.s_quotes_carousel_minimal
msgid ""
"\" This company transformed our business. <br/>Their solutions are "
"innovative and reliable. \""
msgstr ""
"\" ບໍລິສັດນີ້ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງທຸລະກິດຂອງພວກເຮົາ. <br/>ວິທີແກ້ໄຂຂອງພວກເຂົາມີຄວາມສ້າງສັນ ແລະ ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື. \""

#. module: website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website.s_quotes_carousel
msgid ""
"\" We were impressed by their attention to detail. Every step was clear, "
"efficient, and focused on delivering real value. \""
msgstr ""
"\" ພວກເຮົາປະທັບໃຈກັບຄວາມເອົາໃຈໃສ່ໃນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງພວກເຂົາ. ທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນມີຄວາມຈະແຈ້ງ, "
"ມີປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ສຸມໃສ່ການສ້າງຄຸນຄ່າຕົວຈິງ. \""

#. module: website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website.s_blockquote
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website.s_quotes_carousel
msgid ""
"\" Write a quote here from one of your customers. Quotes are a great way to "
"build confidence in your products or services. \""
msgstr ""
"\" ຂຽນຄຳເວົ້າຂອງລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ນີ້. ຄຳເວົ້າຂອງລູກຄ້າເປັນວິທີທີ່ດີເລີດໃນການສ້າງຄວາມໝັ້ນໃຈໃນສິນຄ້າ ຫຼື "
"ບໍລິການຂອງທ່ານ. \""

